  "instance_name": "political_character_assassination",
  "label": "Political Character Assassination",
  "description": "This is a rhetorical strategy in which a person's character is attacked to discredit their policies or arguments, rather than addressing the substance of their claims. The meme is a textbook example of this, using a false accusation (that she 'forgot' 9/11) to delegitimize Rep. Ilhan Omar's political position. This tactic is often used to provoke emotional reactions and distract from actual policy debates.",
